n is based on player skill and training rather than unlocks. Like many arcade style games, personal progress and a high score is the goal. This game quickly becomes difficult and requires an active mindset. Holopoint is designed so that only a few determined archers will reach the last wave.\n\nWARNING: THIS GAME GETS INTENSE. REMEMBER TO BREATHE AND TAKE BREAKS.", "short_description": "Holopoint is pure archery madness. Fight your way through waves of responsive targets, samurai, and highly dangerous ninjas - all while drawing, nocking, and shooting your arrows as quickly as possible."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alzanstudios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alzan Studios, LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.alzanstudios.com/contact", "website_url": "http://www.alzanstudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "242358471386267"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 16, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1878531426925366"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1446902600589296"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "26423001360706303"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "994742936599689"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25032639606417991"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "711992914747400"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1177253087442449"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "468546489047133"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3866884890225269"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "330227858401075"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1992016621182522"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "483350939399094"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "706543204704469"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1295693981824515"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "549058256244600"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "687832922645464"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "26423001360706303"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1878531426925366"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28424822997220128", "version": "R10"}, "id": "2474496075929472", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2202354219893697", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28424822997220128"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793160538, "id": "28477651721937255", "version": "R10", "version_code": 147, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2202354219893697", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28424822997220128"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2474496075929472"}]}, "change_log": "  - New location, the Courtyard: a moonlit night setting with a sakura tree and swinging lanterns. It has 30 new waves in both Waves and Time Trial modes.\n  - New bow to earn: finish the Courtyard to unlock Daburu, the Double Bow.\n  - Energized arrows are now earned by accuracy and pace. Keep up a pace of 30 enemies in 40 seconds with perfect accuracy to ignite your arrows and increase their contact area. Defeating more than one enemy with a single arrow can push accuracy over 100%.\n  - Arrows react to what they hit: they stick in wood and dirt and bounce off stone, and each surface sounds different.\n  - Seasonal secrets:\n    - In autumn, a secret in the Courtyard pumpkin patch temporarily rewards Minori, the Harvest Bow.\n    - In winter, snow falls on the Garden and the Courtyard. Find Yukidama, the Winter Bow hiding among the Yukidaruma (snowmen)\n  - Bow lock: during a match your bow stays in your hand when you let go of the grip.\n  - Update UX for Time Trial and How to Play screens.\n  - New layered music that changes and builds through the Courtyard waves.\n  - Smoother performance and new visuals: better foliage, lighting and frame rate.\n  - New unlock order: the Courtyard opens at Dojo wave 5 and the Garden at Courtyard wave 10. If you already have the Garden pre-update, it will remain unlocked for you.\n  - Stay in the play area: going more than 10 ft up or 20 ft from the centre now ends your run.\n  - Play area guardian auto-centering: The guardian boundary now auto-centers and aligns with the world direction for an optimal experience.\n  - Additional bug fixes and improvements", "created_date": 1792814298, "id": "28424822997220128", "version": "R10", "version_code": 146, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": 